&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Security Specialist Solutions Architect, you will bring deep expertise in SIEM solutions, security technologies, and consultative selling to support customers in securing their data and infrastructure. You will bring to bear your knowledge of vendor ecosystems, security architectures, and operational processes to help customers solve complex challenges, enhance incident response, and build modern, scalable security solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joining Elastic Means Joining a Company That:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empowers you to make a real impact: Your work will directly influence the success of organizations worldwide, helping them unlock new opportunities and make insightful decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offers unparalleled growth opportunities: We cultivate a culture of learning and provide access to world-class training programs and innovative technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connects you with hardworking individuals: Collaborate with a team with varied strengths of engineers, data scientists, and industry experts who are passionate about pushing the boundaries of security analytics and AI-powered solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rewards you for your contributions: Enjoy a competitive compensation and benefits package that reflects your talent and dedication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn More:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our Mission: To help people understand their data and align with their desired outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our Values: Collaboration, Willingness, Customer Focus, and Innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our Culture: We&#39;re a team with varied strengths of hardworking individuals united by a common goal: to make the world a more informed place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect next-generation security solutions: Design and implement innovative solutions using Elastic&#39;s latest advancements in AI, to help improve incident response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Harness the power of the Elastic Security Solution to enable organizations to achieve their use case requirements and improve over

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, every day brings the extraordinary! Whether it’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Daniel Ricciardo’s Formula 1 Car&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/579-fossils&quot;&gt;Woolly Mammoth’s Skeleton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/l/10035805&quot;&gt;Lady Gaga&#39;s Jumpsuit&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Usain Bolt’s running shoe&lt;/a&gt;, we encounter exceptional objects every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a one-of-a-kind marketplace for buying and selling special objects. Each week, more than 100,000 unique items are auctioned, all carefully curated by our passionate in-house experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having sold over 25 million unique objects, our mission is to become the world’s most popular destination for special objects. As a growing, diverse and sustainable scale-up, we proudly live by three core values. If these values resonate with you, we’d love to explore how you can join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership and driving impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being open to change and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being passionate about our mission and our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Your mission&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Manager – Data Engineering &amp;amp; Machine Learning, you’ll lead Catawiki’s established team of Data Engineers and Machine Learning specialists. You’ll help the team grow, set its technical direction and build on work already underway across data foundations and production machine learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role spans two connected disciplines. You’ll bring deep experience in either Data Engineering or Machine Learning Engineering, and enough breadth to set direction across the other.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner with Product, Engineering, Analytics and business stakeholders to set priorities and connect the team’s work to outcomes across Catawiki.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll lead the team through platform modernisation and product-facing ML work. Current priorities include modernising the infrastructure for serving production models, introducing a feature store to improve feature management and consistency across model training and serving, and strengthening observability and cost controls. You’ll help set priorities and raise the reliability and impact of this work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and develop the team:&lt;/strong&gt; Set direction, coach experienced specialists and create clear ownership across Data Engineering and Machine Learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build dependable data foundations:&lt;/strong&gt; Improve the pipelines, integrations and infrastructure the wider Data team relies on for analysis, reporting and machine learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen production ML:&lt;/strong&gt; Improve deployment, monitoring and operational follow-through for production models, so teams can run them reliably and resolve issues effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advance marketplace models:&lt;/strong&gt; Help teams improve recommendation, cancellation and bidder-risk use cases, connecting model performance to meaningful product outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set direction and priorities:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with Product, Engineering, Analytics and business partners to choose high-value problems and balance delivery, reliability and long-term platform health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the technology strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Reporting to the SVP Engineering, you’ll join the Engineering Management team and help shape the direction of the Technology department.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You combine strong technical judgement with experienced people leadership. You create clarity in a complex environment, empower specialists and make sound decisions across both disciplines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your experience will include the following. Familiarity with Catawiki’s current stack is useful, and equivalent experience with other platforms is welcome.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical depth in one discipline:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep experience designing, building and operating data-intensive systems in Data Engineering or Machine Learning Engineering, with practical knowledge of the other.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience leading experienced engineers or ML specialists, coaching their growth and setting clear expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture and systems thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to evaluate trade-offs and guide architecture for data platforms, distributed systems and production infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production ML understanding:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with the deployment, monitoring and operation of machine learning systems in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business and product judgement:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to connect technical work to business goals, make priority calls and assess outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relevant cloud platform experience:&lt;/strong&gt; We run on GCP using BigQuery, Vertex AI and Kubernetes. Experience with equivalent AWS services is also relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Streaming and integration experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Kafka, event-driven systems or modern data integration tools are useful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to explain technical trade-offs and align technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll lead a team of eight Data Engineers and Machine Learning specialists across Amsterdam and Lisbon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The team works closely with Product, Engineering, Analytics and business stakeholders to connect data and ML capabilities to real needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Specialists own implementation while you set direction, priorities and clear standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The team supports production data and ML systems, and has no on-call rotation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you&#39;ll be&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a &lt;em&gt;hybrid&lt;/em&gt; role in Amsterdam. You will work from our Amsterdam HQ a minimum of 2 days per week.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text text-align-left &quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working with Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a visible impact &lt;/strong&gt;by working at scale in a global organisation serving millions of customers across 80+ categories. In our flat structure, every role has a broad scope and directly impacts both our customers and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow&lt;/strong&gt; through our Learning &amp;amp; Development initiatives, including clear development plans and mentorship programmes to support your career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of connection defines us&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re a passionate, diverse team of 800+ Catawikians representing 60+ nationalities. We foster an inclusive and queer-friendly environment where everyone is encouraged to bring their full self to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celebrate life’s moments with us. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll receive a €100 Catavoucher when you join, a €50 Catavoucher on your birthday, and an extra day off each year to “Pursue Your Passion&lt;strong&gt;”&lt;/strong&gt;. We also offer additional leave for key work anniversaries and important life events. Benefits may vary by location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offices and Way of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our vibrant offices in Amsterdam and Lisbon are designed to inspire collaboration. Most Catawikians operate in a hybrid setup, combining office-based and remote work, with a minimum of two days per week in the office, unless a role is explicitly stated as fully remote or fully office-based.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply with an English CV and Cover Letter. By applying, you agree to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/conditions/applicant-privacy-policy.pdf&quot;&gt;Catawiki’s Applicant Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support the review of your application. AI may help us assess how your experience matches the requirements of the role, but hiring decisions are always made by our recruitment team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Workwize&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Workwize helps companies equip their remote and global teams with IT equipment. Our SaaS platform takes care of buying, delivering, managing and returning laptops and other devices in more than 100 countries. Today more than 50,000 users and 120,000 devices are managed through Workwize.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead the team that builds the systems behind our finance and internal operations. That means billing, invoicing and the internal tools our Operations and Finance teams use every day. The team is small but has a big impact. Mistakes here are expensive, so quality and good judgement matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You lead the engineers, work closely with the team&#39;s Product Manager and report to the Engineering Manager. You also work directly with senior leadership. You own the people, the way the team works and the delivery of the roadmap. You stay close to the code: about 30 to 40% of your time goes to code reviews, technical design and some hands-on work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and grow your engineers through 1:1s, clear feedback and growth plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set a clear bar for performance, and act early when someone is not meeting it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own delivery of the team&#39;s roadmap and keep progress, risks and blockers visible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan the roadmap and quarterly goals with Product, Operations and Finance, including what we say no to&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run planning, refinement and retros, and represent the team in talks with other teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep standards high on code review, testing, monitoring, security and incident follow-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire new engineers for your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set good habits for using AI tools in development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years as a software engineer, including at least 1 to 2 years managing engineers with direct reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience handling performance issues: setting expectations, giving hard feedback and supporting someone who is struggling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A leadership style that can switch between directing and coaching, depending on the situation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence to explain and defend your point of view to senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with a modern web stack. We use Laravel (PHP), Node.js, React, Filament and MySQL. You don&#39;t need to know all of them, because strong engineers learn them fast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of delivering B2B web products end to end, working with non-technical colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily use of AI tools in your development work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written and spoken English (Dutch is not needed)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in FinTech, or with finance and billing systems (invoicing, order-to-cash, tax, or accounting and ERP integrations like Exact or QuickBooks)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Laravel Filament or other admin panel tools, or moving internal tools off low-code platforms like Retool&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building LLM features or AI agents for internal operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale-up experience, ideally in B2B SaaS, logistics or operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you will work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In the Netherlands: hybrid, 2 to 3 days a week in our Amsterdam office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elsewhere in EMEA: remote, with working hours that overlap with CET and occasional visits to Amsterdam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call with Talent Acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Short video interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team fit interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Case study: two short role-play scenarios with the panel. You don&#39;t need to prepare.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible hybrid work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top tools and equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An entrepreneurial culture with room to grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Off-sites and team events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team lunches and surprise events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ClassPass corporate membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Flexport:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Flexport, we believe global trade can move the human race forward. That’s why it’s our mission to make global commerce so easy there will be more of it. We’re shaping the future of a $10T industry with solutions powered by innovative technology and exceptional people. Today, companies of all sizes—from emerging brands to Fortune 500s—use Flexport technology to move more than $19B of merchandise across 112 countries a year.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The recent global supply chain crisis has put Flexport center stage as we continue to play a pivotal role in how goods move around the world. We are proud to have the support of the best investors in the game who believe in our mission, solutions and people. Ready to tackle global challenges that impact business, society, and the environment? Come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Staff Software Engineer: Applied AI&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every day, thousands of shipments cross borders, change hands, and hit unexpected problems. For decades, fixing those problems meant phone calls, emails, and humans heroically firefighting. We think that&#39;s about to change completely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;ve been building AI agents that spot trouble before it happens, reroute shipments, and keep goods moving—with our team of experts in the loop where it counts. The early results have been jaw-dropping. We&#39;re now going all in on a future where supply chains run themselves, and we&#39;re looking for the people who want to build that future with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t a role where you join a team and pick up tickets. You&#39;ll find the highest-leverage problems, design the solutions, and ship them to operators moving freight across 112 countries. If that sounds like your idea of a good time, read on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll build the cutting-edge agents and AI-powered applications that make Flexport&#39;s operations smarter, faster, and increasingly autonomous. That means:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and shipping &lt;strong&gt;end-to-end AI agents&lt;/strong&gt; that handle real logistics work—customs compliance, document processing, exception management, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Crossing organizational boundaries&lt;/strong&gt; to understand problems deeply, align stakeholders, and get things done without waiting for permission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Moving fast from idea to production, treating every deployment as a learning opportunity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working directly with operators, domain experts, and leadership to turn ambiguous problems into shipped solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You Should Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10+ years of software engineering experience&lt;/strong&gt;; you&#39;ve built with LLMs extensively — whether in production, side projects, or just because you couldn&#39;t stop yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong product instincts&lt;/strong&gt;: you can identify what&#39;s worth building, not just execute on a spec&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LLM fluency&lt;/strong&gt;: agent patterns, RAG, prompt engineering, tool use, evaluation. You know what works in production and what looks good in demos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-stack capability&lt;/strong&gt; in TypeScript and Next.js—you can own a feature end to end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An entrepreneurial drive&lt;/strong&gt;: you thrive in ambiguity, move fast, and don&#39;t wait to be told what to do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent communication&lt;/strong&gt;: you can work across teams and disciplines to get alignment and unblock yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An audacious appetite for impact&lt;/strong&gt;: you&#39;re not here to maintain—you&#39;re here to change how global trade works&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with workflow orchestration (Temporal, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building internal tools or operator-facing applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How We Work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We come to the office 3 times a week to hang out, whiteboard, and ship together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have the latest hardware and software—including frontier AI models on day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We&#39;re agile, but not dogmatic. Teams decide how they work best&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stack&lt;/strong&gt;: Next.js, TypeScript, Postgres, Snowflake. For AI: Anthropic, OpenAI, Google AI APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why This Role Is Special&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your work is visible&lt;/strong&gt;: This is a small, senior team reporting directly to the VP of Engineering. What you build gets noticed, and your ideas shape the direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real stakes&lt;/strong&gt;: thousands of containers, 112 countries, $19 billion of goods. Your agents will have immediate, measurable impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: from problem definition to production deployment, it&#39;s yours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re early&lt;/strong&gt;: the playbook for applied AI in enterprise logistics doesn&#39;t exist yet—you&#39;ll help write it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An opportunity to contribute to one of the fastest-growing companies, where you’ll have the chance to create a global impact while being a part of a&amp;nbsp; thriving multinational environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily catered lunches incl. vegetarian options, breakfast, snacks and soft drinks available in our office on daily basis&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commute expenses: Flexport will cover&amp;nbsp; home-office commuting costs for employees living outside of Amsterdam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 working days as vacation days based on full time employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance: Flexport offers a collective health insurance plan including a basic package and any available additional packages. Your monthly premium is fully paid by Flexport.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A defined pension contribution scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity program: every team member becomes a shareholder, aligning our success with yours. As a private company in a multi-trillion dollar industry, you have a direct stake in our collective growth and success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program through Aetna Resources for Living: Flexport provides an employer-sponsored program at no cost to you and your household members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave benefit: Flexport is here to support you and your families in one of the most important times in life – the birth of a child! Our parental leave program allows both mothers and partners to take time off from work for pregnancy, childbirth, and to bond with your new child.&lt;/li&gt;
